124
00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:13.240
I went on into this kind of almost game
like world where you have entities

125
00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:19.440
and then you play out
different actions on them.

126
00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:23.320
And then Watson basically went and created
